    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d369">

                <pb facs="0540" n="498" xml:id="pg498"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1863-01-26"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 26, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your communication of the 29th ultimo, calling the attention of this
                    government to the refusal of Acting Rear-Admiral Wilkes to communicate with a
                    boat belonging to her Majesty’s ship Barracouta on a late occasion.</p>
                <p>Having communicated a copy of it to the Secretary of the Navy, I now have the
                    honor to enclose to you a transcript of his reply under date of the 6th instant,
                    and to renew to you the assurance of my high consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d369-a1.xml" xpointer="d369-a1"/>
            </div>
